From d891491cfe4d1135cd65277a4603b87d65d99d24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:03:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(designsystem): every component, grouped into patterns,
 in detail

The Components section of /designsystem becomes Components and patterns:
all 71 components in src/components, in 10 patterns (actions, inputs,
navigation, cards, sheets, cockpit, progress, loading and motion, brand,
plumbing), each pattern with guidance and rules, each component with
purpose, when to use, where it appears, its states, its Figma node, a
live demo where it renders on its own (28), and its props read from its
own source by a small parser. A test fails when a component file is
added without a catalogue entry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
